-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON SCOPE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This MIT license covers Carlos Rodas's original content in this repository
only: the Sigma detection rules, scripts, and documentation authored here.

It does NOT cover the third-party sample log files under logs/, which are
redistributed from their upstream projects and retain their own licensing:

  - Files sourced from OTRF/Security-Datasets are MIT-licensed (vendored,
    i.e. committed into this repo, with attribution).
  - Files sourced from GPL-3.0 projects (e.g. sbousseaden/EVTX-ATTACK-SAMPLES)
    are NOT committed; they are downloaded on demand by a fetch script and
    kept out of git via .gitignore.

See logs/ATTRIBUTION.md for the full per-file source and license breakdown.
